url: 'https://popylar-org.github.io/2026-11-05_workshop-coimbra/'
abstract: >-
  Website and materials for the Popylar population receptive
  field (pRF) modelling workshop at the University of Coimbra
  (5–6 November 2026). The materials contain hands-on
  practicals that show how to fit pRF and related models
  to neuroimaging data (fMRI and ECoG) with the prfmodel
  Python package.
